From 478a00dfc37e698ad56c247ba4557f4c401713e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:21:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-237: Living Azeroth wind and grass parting (port
 of wxl-seyris-living-azeroth by Morfium-G, GPL-3.0, used with the author's
 permission)

- HdLivingWorld: per-frame snapshot of the player's map, area chain, weather and the 16 nearest units
- HdLivingWind: WindProfile.cdbc (DBFilesClient) Global/Map/Area profiles, steady wind, gusts, roof shelter and lee
- HdGrassWind: an 8x8 wind grid around the player (c96..c159) and the units (c192..c207) for the HD grass vertex shader;
  hdGrassReact / hdGrassReactRadius / hdGrassWindInfo
- HdDetailDoodad: GrassOffset bends the blade from the grid with a per-blade flutter and parts it around units

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
